WEBVTT

00:04:59.996 --> 00:05:01.163
for for everything we do.

00:05:01.496 --> 00:05:06.704
What's so cool about the blacklist is you
basically found a way to give people

00:05:06.704 --> 00:05:09.413
an excuse to trust their actual taste

00:05:09.413 --> 00:05:12.371
and to say like this thing that we really
love, we actually can make.

00:05:13.496 --> 00:05:15.788
And I think that's a really powerful
thing across industries,

00:05:15.788 --> 00:05:17.704
not even just in Hollywood.
I think that's right.

00:05:17.704 --> 00:05:21.163
Look, and I don't think that it's that
Hollywood lacks imagination.

00:05:21.163 --> 00:05:24.454
I mean, I can say concretely, having
worked in the business for now,

00:05:24.454 --> 00:05:26.746
for coming up on 18 years,

00:05:27.079 --> 00:05:30.621
the people that work in Hollywood are
wildly imaginative and wildly talented.